TC 4-1-1: EXISTS subquery WHERE, result and plan     

===================================================
ca    
1     

Query plan:
follow
    edge:  tb node[?] cr -> tc node[?]
    head:  sscan
              class: tb node[?]
              sargs: term[?] AND term[?]
              cost:  ? card ?
    sargs: term[?] AND term[?]
    cost:  ? card ?
Query stmt:
(select ? from tb tb where tb.ca=ta.ca and (tb.cr.cb> ?:? ) and inst_num()<= ?:? )
Query plan:
temp(order by)
    subplan: sscan
                 class: ta node[?]
                 sargs: term[?]
                 subqs: ?
                 cost:  ? card ?
    sort:  ? asc
    cost:  ? card ?
Query stmt:
select ta.ca from ta ta where  exists (select ? from tb tb where tb.ca=ta.ca and (tb.cr.cb> ?:? ) and inst_num()<= ?:? ) order by ?
